gate: OPEN
v:4 c:$ m:navitrack-config role:dev x:frontend
task: S16 T7 — Sensor catalog grid — one active, extensible
sprint: S16
requires: [FRONTEND_DEV, BUN]
test_mandate: ../intel/TEST-COVERAGE-MANDATE.md
quality_mandate: ../intel/CODE-QUALITY-MANDATE.md

context: |
  Intake #3 ref 03-sensor-catalog. 2-col product cards: category, model, optional image, CTA chevron.
  Data-driven catalog: ≥1 enabled = current NaviTrack fuel BLE DUT → existing scan/session flow.
  Extra placeholder products allowed as disabled/comingSoon (future many sensors) — no fake BLE for them.
  Connection tabs: Bluetooth only (or RS-485 visible-but-disabled). QR optional stub — not required.
  Package manager: bun.

out:
  - src/screens/catalog/* (or sensors catalog)
  - src/config/sensor-catalog.ts (extensible list)
  - locales + *.test.ts(x)

cmd:
  - bun run test

done:
  - Catalog renders grid; enabled product opens scan/session path
  - Disabled/future products non-navigating + labelled
  - Adding a catalog entry is data-only (extensibility proven in test)
  - `bun run test` passes
